  "body": "Floor area 176.4m² | 4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms | Freehold Title | 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nLooking for a brand-new four-bedroom home in Bucklands Beach without the premium price tag of a traditional standalone house? This is an opportunity worth exploring!\r\n\r\nThese architecturally designed, three-level townhouses combine contemporary style, generous space and everyday convenience — perfect for modern family living.\r\n\r\nLot 1 and Lot 4 are SOLD — only Lot 3 and Lot 5 remain!\r\n\r\n- Designed for Modern Living:\r\n• Approx. 176.4m² of spacious living\r\n• Four bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, including two master suites\r\n• Designer kitchen with quality appliances\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living and dining\r\n• Sunny balcony and private outdoor entertaining area\r\n• Internal-access single garage plus additional parking\r\n\r\n- Confidence in Your Purchase:\r\n• Freehold title\r\n• No Body Corporate fees or Society fees\r\n• CCC and Title issued\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\n- Convenient Location & Schooling:\r\nEnjoy easy access to Highland Park Shopping Centre, Pak’nSave, Woolworths, cafés, restaurants and parks.\r\n\r\nLocated within the school zones for Macleans Primary, Howick Intermediate and Pakuranga College.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re a first-home buyer, growing family or investor, this is a fantastic opportunity to secure a brand-new home in a sought-after East Auckland location.\r\n\r\n- JUST TWO HOMES AVAILABLE - LOT 3 & LOT 5!\r\n\r\nModern design. Generous space. Freehold ownership. A convenient location.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss out — contact us today to arrange your viewing and secure your preferred home before it’s gone!",
